From c334c969af50c92830a034a9bbafbb28500364a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 02:06:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 194/217] fix: startup crash - a // comment on a #define line
 is a null deref in CryFX

CShaderManBin::SaveBinShader copies a macro body up to, but not including,
its newline, then SkipComments handles a // comment with strchr(buf, '\n'),
which returns NULL for that buffer; the caller reads b[0] and the editor
dies in the shader parser before any level loads (three crashes on
2026-09-14). No stock shader has a comment on a #define line, which is why
it never showed. The three RT_* defines lose their trailing comments.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SCUvWGLCsqzm3VNMzp4uiS
---
 Engine/Shaders/HWScripts/CryFX/CommonSVO_RT.cfi | 12 +++++++++---
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Engine/Shaders/HWScripts/CryFX/CommonSVO_RT.cfi b/Engine/Shaders/HWScripts/CryFX/CommonSVO_RT.cfi
index 1ccf3138..a1dd7094 100644
--- a/Engine/Shaders/HWScripts/CryFX/CommonSVO_RT.cfi
+++ b/Engine/Shaders/HWScripts/CryFX/CommonSVO_RT.cfi
@@ -305,9 +305,15 @@ float PackRGB(const float3 col)
 // the round trip is deterministic and testable.
 ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
 
-#define RT_HUE_RANGE     6      // levels per channel in the reflectance hue code (6^3 = 216)
-#define RT_SMOOTH_STEPS  255    // smoothIdx in [0, 255]
-#define RT_GREY_STEPS    255    // greyIdx   in [0, 255]
+// CryFX pitfall: never put a // comment on a #define line. SaveBinShader copies the macro body
+// without its newline and SkipComments then does strchr(buf, '
+') -> NULL -> the engine
+// dereferences it at startup (2026-09-14 crash). Comments go on their own lines.
+// RT_HUE_RANGE: levels per channel in the reflectance hue code (6^3 = 216).
+// RT_SMOOTH_STEPS: smoothIdx in [0, 255]. RT_GREY_STEPS: greyIdx in [0, 255].
+#define RT_HUE_RANGE     6
+#define RT_SMOOTH_STEPS  255
+#define RT_GREY_STEPS    255
 
 float RT_PackHitMaterial(const float3 vReflectance, const float fSmoothness)
 {
